      "writtenOn": "2026-05-28T16:05:58Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "On production Android builds we disable Live patching and KPROBES.\n\nThe freeze is intentionally delayed to late_initcall_sync() to avoid conflicts with jump labels/static keys and tracing initialization. We are validating remaining post-boot text patchers (kprobes/ftrace/livepatch/module apply paths) before enforcement.\n\nWith recent agentic solution deployment, we are seeing rogue models breaching security threats, here we are limiting these via AUTO FLEX requirements.\n\nmodule load are disabled post freeze",
